graph TD
    A([User accesses web app]) --> B[Enters login credentials]
    B --> C{Backend verifies via Database}
    C -- Failure --> D[Show Error Message]
    C -- Success --> E[Frontend loads Editor Page]
    E --> F[Frontend requests file tree via API]
    F --> G[Backend retrieves file structure]
    G --> H([Frontend renders File Explorer and Editor UI])
    
    style A fill:#4caf50,stroke:#388e3c,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style C fill:#ff9800,stroke:#f57c00,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style H fill:#2196f3,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
